      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2cfb14fad44cf65",
      "translationZh": "刚看到 OpenBMB 的这个 MiniCPM-V 4.7 演示，它的端侧能力相当令人印象深刻。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b491a3b6521d624",
      "translationZh": "一个 35B-A3B 的 MoE 视觉语言模型能在移动设备上本地运行，本身就已经很有意思，但真正吸引我注意的是这些应用场景：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "210156dd054e6a2b",
      "translationZh": "📷 读取现实世界中的标识",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "823d40a1bd2e5ca9",
      "translationZh": "📄 理解复杂文档",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a60f8d27ef40126b",
      "translationZh": "🧠 基于视觉信息进行推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c567d0a56367945b",
      "translationZh": "🗺️ 在现实世界的约束下进行规划",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2269af848fa1d17",
      "translationZh": "关键似乎在于 LES（Lookahead Expert Scheduling，前瞻式专家调度）——他们并非只是把模型做得更小，而是通过预测并预加载专家来优化 MoE 推理，以减少瓶颈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a42f13a5b96081d",
      "translationZh": "他们还发布了更小的 MiniCPM-V 4.7 1B 模型，面向资源更受限的设备。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7f8b205be02b7b5",
      "translationZh": "另一项有趣的新增功能是自回放微调（Self-Replay Fine-Tuning，SRFT），旨在让开发者针对特定任务定制模型，同时保留其通用能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24a230801992c826",
      "translationZh": "这个方向很有意思：我们正越来越接近让功能强大的多模态助手直接在手机上运行，而不是把每张图像或每个问题都发送到云端。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4d13092ecc866ee",
      "translationZh": "SRFT 详情：https://openbmb.cn/en/blog/self-replay-fine-tuning",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
